    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaamu agateebhia Bharaki iga, “Nhagaachëra hano amakëngë muhungatë hakurua öndentere ichigaini muhungatë na ichiguruki muhungatë.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaki agakora keebhörë Bharaamu amöteebhiri. Bhakamuensa kömakëngë gaara iching'ombe chiira na ichiguruki chiira, këra irikëngë iguruki imui na ëgaini imui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua Bharaamu agateebhia Bharaki, “Taimëërra hano hang'i na ikimuenso ke gösambërëërröa keeo na uni niyi; handë ÖMÖNENE narasikane na uni, na kërë gionsui aranteebhi nëndaache ngöteebhi.” Köhayö Bharaamu akaya umuene kurua nsung'unuuni yi inguku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ënooköë agasikana nawe. Bharaamu akamöteebhia iga, “Nseemiri amakëngë muhungatë, na harë këra ëkëngë muensërë ko iguruki imui na ëgaini imui.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ënooköë agatööra amang'ana kumunyua go Bharaamu, akamöteebhia iga ringa harë Bharaki, ömöteebhi ëng'ana ëno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaamu akamörëngëra na kunyoora Bharaki na abhanene bhonsui bha Moabhu bhaimërëëyë mbarëka yi ikimuenso ke gösambërëërröa keee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayö bhoono Bharaki agateebhia Bharaamu iga, “Nkë këno önkoreeyë? Nënkörentërë hano iga, wihiime abhabhisa bhaane guiki öbhaitabhiiyi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaamu agateebhia Bharaki iga, “Kuhika ngambe gaara ÖMÖNENE anteebhiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Öbhönaabhi bho kabhërë bho Bharaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua, Bharaki agateebhia Bharaamu iga, “Tötaya ötöörre ahandë, harë örabhamaahe bhuuya; ninyoora niigo ni irig'ënga reebho öramaahe; köbhayö öramaahe, öbhanyihiimëre kurua hayö ökömaaha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö Bharaki akamuhira kömögöndö go Sobhimu, kurua nsung'unuui yi inguku ya Bhisiga. Akahagaacha ho amakëngë muhungatë, na kumuensa harë këra ëkëngë iguruki na ëgaini imui. Bharaamu agateebhia Bharaki iga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imëërra hano mbarëka yi ikimuenso ke gösambërëërröa keeo na uni niyi gusikana na ÖMÖNENE ihumbu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ÖMÖNENE agasikana na Bharaamu na kömöha amang'ana ga kögamba na akamöbhöörra iga aringe kuya harë Bharaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaringa na kumunyoora akimërëëyë mbarëka yi ikimuenso ke gösambërëërröa hamui na abhasigiki bhaae. Akamubhuuria iga, “ÖMÖNENE nkë agateebhiri?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaamu bhoono akarëa ënaabhi iga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua Bharaki agateebhia Bharaamu iga, “Bhoono mbe ötakabhaihiima gösë köbhaitabhiria iga hai!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono Bharaamu akahunchukiria Bharaki iga, “Niyekë, tënaarë ngöteebhiri iga këno ÖMÖNENE aragambe nkio giisërë iga nkore?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaki agateebhia Bharaamu iga, “Ötaacha nkuhire ahandë kanyoora Ënooköë agaitabhiirria wihiime abhantö bhayö gikugira yaane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaki akaimukia Bharaamu na kumuhira gunsung'unuuni yi inguku ya Bheori, ëno ömöntö akuimëërra amaaha bhuuya kuibhara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaamu agateebhia Bharaki iga, “Nhagaachëra amakëngë gandë muhungatë hano, na önseemiri ichigaini muhungatë na ichiguruki muhungatë.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharaki agakora keebhörë Bhaaramu amöteebhiri, na kumuensa iguruki na ëgaini harë këra ikëngë.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
